{
  "name": "RPA: Hello world",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Hello world\nSet the RPA Browser credential, then click Execute.\n\n1. Pick your **RPA Browser** credential on both RPA nodes.\n2. **Screenshot example.com** visits one public site and returns a PNG.\n3. **Extract the sandbox table** reads a table from the sandbox site that ships with the compose stack. That site is on your own network, so **Options -> Allow Private Network** is on for this node only. Leave it off for public sites.\n\nIf the first run says it could not connect, the browser is not running. Start it with `docker compose up -d browser` (README: Where the browser runs).",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "5a1b2c3d-4e5f-4a60-8b70-000000000501",
      "name": "Before you click Execute",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-60, -420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "5a1b2c3d-4e5f-4a60-8b70-000000000502",
      "name": "Click Execute",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "screenshot",
        "url": "https://example.com"
      },
      "id": "5a1b2c3d-4e5f-4a60-8b70-000000000503",
      "name": "Screenshot example.com",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-rpa.playwright",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "extract",
        "url": "http://sandbox:8080/public/table",
        "shape": "table",
        "table": { "locator": { "findBy": "css", "css": "table.results" } },
        "options": { "allowPrivateNetwork": true }
      },
      "id": "5a1b2c3d-4e5f-4a60-8b70-000000000504",
      "name": "Extract the sandbox table",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-rpa.playwright",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [480, 0]
    }
